title: "EnergyFlow.jl"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
abstract: >-
  A Julia package for computing the Energy Mover's Distance between collider
  events, with exact and approximate optimal-transport backends, configurable
  ground metrics, pairwise computations, and event-isotropy utilities.
keywords:
  - energy mover's distance
  - optimal transport
  - collider physics
  - Julia
